(
    title: "Tomcat - The F-14 Fighter Simulator",
    developer: Some("Dan Kitchen, Steven Kitchen"),
    description: Some("A carrier-based flight simulator: catapult-launch an F-14 off the U.S.S. Enterprise, fly by instruments across several computer-display screens, fight incoming bogeys with the M-61 cannon, three types of guided missile and electronic countermeasures, then set down on the deck again — later missions run in total darkness. The console\'s difficulty switches work the landing gear and arresting hook, and every flight ends with a mission rating from 0 to 9."),
